{{!-- One member's line. Two lines, in fact, on a grid: the member's place in the marching order
      and a portrait spanning both, then who they are with the row's two controls on the first
      line, and what they are carrying on the second, under the name.

      The journey's crew row (`templates/apps/journey/watch.hbs`) puts all of that on one line,
      and this row tried to as well. It does not fit: the crew row carries three tags and this
      one carries up to seven — the whole 2e statline plus slots and Fatigue — and at the sheet's
      600px a long name was ellipsed to make room for them. A name is the one thing on the row
      that must be read in full, so the load takes its own line instead.

      `data-index` is the member's place in `system.members`, NOT its place in the list being
      drawn. The two tabs are filtered views of one array and the array's order is the party's
      marching order, so a row that carried its screen position would edit the wrong member.
      `order` is that same place, printed: the Party tab may read 1 and 3 with the Followers
      tab's 2 between them, because a mule can walk second.

      The last two readings are a player character's alone: an NPC keeps no ten-slot ledger and
      takes no Fatigue, so the follower's row simply has fewer tags rather than empty ones. --}}
<li class="cairn-slot cairn-party-member draggable{{#unless deployed}} is-held{{/unless}}"
    data-uuid="{{uuid}}" data-index="{{index}}"
    {{#unless @last}}data-ink="hline" data-ink-seed="party-member-{{id}}" data-ink-w="0.9" data-ink-a="0.42" data-ink-at="bottom"{{/unless}}>

    <span class="cairn-slot-number" data-tooltip-text="{{localize 'CAIRN.Party.Order'}}">{{order}}</span>

    {{!-- The portrait alone opens the member's sheet: a name is read, and a control the eye does
          not expect under a word is the mis-click the remove control already keeps away from. --}}
    <button type="button" class="cairn-party-who" data-action="memberOpen"
            data-tooltip-text="{{localize 'CAIRN.Party.OpenSheet' name=name}}"
            aria-label="{{localize 'CAIRN.Party.OpenSheet' name=name}}">
        <img class="cairn-party-portrait" src="{{img}}" alt="" />
    </button>

    {{!-- The name, and at its right every condition the member is under. A condition is its own
          icon: the token HUD and the member's sheet already taught the table what each looks
          like, and the hover says it in words. --}}
    <span class="cairn-party-headline">
        <span class="cairn-party-name">{{name}}</span>
        {{#each conditions as |c|}}
        <img class="cairn-party-condition" src="{{c.img}}" alt="{{c.label}}" data-tooltip-text="{{c.label}}" />
        {{/each}}
    </span>

    <span class="cairn-item-controls">
        {{#if @root.editable}}
        <a data-action="memberRemove" data-tooltip="{{localize 'CAIRN.Party.Remove'}}"><i class="fas fa-xmark"></i></a>
        {{/if}}
    </span>

    {{!-- Held back, not removed: the member stays on the roster and the party's token leaves
          them where they are. The switch reports the row it sits on, which carries the index. --}}
    {{> "systems/cairn2e/templates/parts/toggle.hbs" value=deployed tooltip=deployHint
        action="memberDeployToggle"}}

    {{!-- Second line: everything the member is walking around with. --}}
    <span class="cairn-party-load">
        <span class="cairn-item-tag" data-tooltip-text="{{localize 'CAIRN.HitProtection'}}">
            {{localize 'CAIRN.HitProtection'}} {{hp.value}}/{{hp.max}}
        </span>
        {{#each abilities as |a|}}
        <span class="cairn-item-tag" data-tooltip-text="{{localize a.key}}">
            {{localize a.key}} {{a.value}}/{{a.max}}
        </span>
        {{/each}}
        <span class="cairn-item-tag" data-tooltip-text="{{localize 'CAIRN.Armor'}}">
            <i class="fas fa-shield-halved" inert></i> {{armor}}
        </span>
        {{#if slots}}
        <span class="cairn-item-tag" data-tooltip-text="{{localize 'CAIRN.Slots'}}">
            <i class="fas fa-box-open" inert></i> {{slots.used}}/{{slots.max}}
        </span>
        {{/if}}
        {{#if fatigue}}
        <span class="cairn-item-tag" data-tooltip-text="{{localize 'CAIRN.Fatigue'}}">
            <i class="fas fa-weight-hanging" inert></i> {{fatigue}}
        </span>
        {{/if}}
    </span>
</li>
